lines=['# Float MoE accumulator workspace','',f'Source checkpoint `{head}`; baseline is `098f7d3f1052746d1600d91de2b436e359a7b2be` (two projection banks plus the separate unaligned-storage fix).','', '## Change and accounting scope','', 'The final rows*hidden f32 accumulator moves from an independently allocated Vec into a third disjoint region of the existing admitted Host workspace lane. It is initialized once per dispatch and survives all expert groups. It has no top-k or expert-count multiplier. A/B reuse and accumulation order are unchanged. The final narrowing/strided write stays after all input reads, including aliased input/output storage. No new public EP interface or quota callback is added.','', 'Each measured requirement increases by exactly rows*hidden*4 bytes, verified against actual funding. This accounts for an existing result allocation; it is not evidence that total live memory or RSS falls. Routing, widening, final output owners and GEMM internals remain outside this workspace cap. Larger retained lanes continue to be charged at physical capacity.','', '## Protocol','', 'Apple M1 Max, macOS arm64, native CPU EP, synthetic public InferenceSession prepare/run/output-drop. Eight shapes, three independent processes per baseline/after/identical-baseline null arm, nine timed batches per process, 100 ms target CPU time per pilot-selected batch. Pilots are excluded. Arm order rotates across processes. The complete sweep holds the shared stable flock used by the llama.cpp peer; process-start load snapshots are retained locally. There is no continuous foreign-CPU telemetry. A same-binary Relu control and ±5% control gate expose drift; they do not prove an otherwise idle machine.','', 'Complete f32 outputs and row argmaxes match in all 72 formal processes. This is a synthetic session comparison, not a model/token-throughput or CUDA claim. Binary/probe hashes and raw batches are in provenance.json and runs.json.','', '| rows / H / I / threads / variant | CPU after vs base | null vs base | control after / null | duration / control gate | workspace before → after |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---|---:|']
